---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import CinemaDiscovery from '../../components/CinemaDiscovery.astro';
import ArticleByline from '../../components/ArticleByline.astro';
import ArticleReadingPath from '../../components/ArticleReadingPath.astro';
import {cinema,picture} from '../../lib/cinema-article.mjs';
import '../../styles/article-reading.css';
const lead=cinema.articles.find(a=>a.slug==='odia-cinema'),hero=lead.images.find(i=>i.role==='title');
const mb=n=>(n/1000000).toFixed(1)+' MB';
---
<Shell title="Odia Cinema: A Living Screen — the book" description="Download the connected digital and printable book about Odia cinema, literature, radio, television and the people making stories." active="explore" related={false} shareImage={{src:hero.file,alt:lead.hero.alt,width:hero.width,height:hero.height}}>
 <article class="article-reading cinema-book"><p><a href="/cinema/">← The cinema readings</a></p><h1>Odia Cinema:<br/>A Living Screen</h1><p>Stories, People and the Places Between</p><ArticleByline author="Ahimanikya Satapathy"/>

  <p>The collection opens with <a href="/cinema/the-question-that-brought-me-here/">The Question That Brought Me Here</a>, the author’s personal introduction. The online collection brings {cinema.articles.length} readings into {cinema.parts.length} parts, with connecting threads, a people guide, dated turning points and linked image credits.</p>
  <h2>Available PDF edition · 31 October 2026</h2>
  <p>These downloads contain the 50 readings in the 31 October review edition, with linked sources and image credits.</p>
  <ul>{cinema.review_books.map(book=><li><a href={book.file}>{book.edition==='digital'?'Digital reading edition · 31 October 2026':'Printable reading edition · 31 October 2026'} — PDF, {mb(book.bytes)}</a>. {book.pages} pages. {book.edition==='digital'?'Linked contents, chapter references and sources.':'Mirrored margins, printed source URLs and credited images.'}</li>)}</ul>
  <figure class="book-cover"><img src="/assets/cinema/a-living-screen-cover-20261027.jpg" width="800" height="1199" alt="Odia Cinema: A Living Screen, with a symbolic household scene on the front cover" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>Cover of Odia Cinema: A Living Screen.</figcaption></figure>
  <p>The <a href="/cinema/">online reading collection</a> offers the expanded sequence in accessible HTML. These PDF reading editions have bookmarks and links but are not tagged accessibility editions.</p>
  <CinemaDiscovery heading="Explore the online collection"/>
  <h2>Earlier published edition · 30 October 2026</h2><p>The 41-reading edition remains available as an archive.</p><ul><li><a href="https://github.com/ahimanikya/project-odisha/releases/download/odia-cinema-book-2026-10-30/odia-cinema-a-living-screen-2026-10-30-open-possibilities.pdf">Digital reading edition · 30 October 2026 — PDF, 17.1 MB</a>. 235 pages.</li><li><a href="https://github.com/ahimanikya/project-odisha/releases/download/odia-cinema-book-2026-10-30/odia-cinema-a-living-screen-print-2026-10-30-open-possibilities.pdf">Printable reading edition · 30 October 2026 — PDF, 40.0 MB</a>. 260 pages.</li></ul>
  <h2>Earlier published edition · 27 October 2026</h2><p>The 28-reading edition remains available as an archive.</p><ul><li><a href="https://github.com/ahimanikya/project-odisha/releases/download/odia-cinema-book-2026-10-27/odia-cinema-a-living-screen-2026-10-27.pdf">Digital reading edition · 27 October 2026 — PDF, 12.9 MB</a>. 176 pages.</li><li><a href="https://github.com/ahimanikya/project-odisha/releases/download/odia-cinema-book-2026-10-27/odia-cinema-a-living-screen-print-2026-10-27.pdf">Printable reading edition · 27 October 2026 — PDF, 132.4 MB</a>. 196 pages.</li></ul>
  <h2>Earlier published edition · 26 October 2026</h2><p>The fourteen-chapter edition of 26 October 2026 remains available as an archive; it predates the current introduction and later readings.</p><ul><li><a href="https://github.com/ahimanikya/project-odisha/releases/download/odia-cinema-book-2026-10-26/odia-cinema-a-living-screen.pdf">Digital reading edition · 26 October 2026 — PDF, {mb(cinema.books[0].bytes)}</a>. Hosted as a Project Odisha release download. 95 pages, linked contents and sources.</li><li><a href="https://github.com/ahimanikya/project-odisha/releases/download/odia-cinema-book-2026-10-26/odia-cinema-a-living-screen-print.pdf">Printable reading edition · 26 October 2026 — PDF download, {mb(cinema.books[1].bytes)}</a>. Hosted as a Project Odisha release download. 106 pages, mirrored margins, printed source URLs and credited images.</li></ul>
  <h2>Printing the book</h2><p>The print edition uses a 6 × 9 inch page. Print at 100% on matching stock, duplex with long-edge binding, or ask a print shop to impose and trim it to that size. For A4 or Letter home printing, choose fit-to-page and expect a different finished size. This is a reading edition, not a printer-specific press-ready PDF.</p>
  <p>Downloadable PDF edition dated 31 October 2026; earlier published editions remain available above. Documentary images retain their credits and reuse terms; imagined illustrations are labelled. The book offers a sourced reading of this history, not a definitive account of every Odia film.</p>
  <ArticleReadingPath links={[{href:'/cinema/',title:'Read the connected articles online'},{href:'/cinema/watch/',title:'Open the viewing room',description:'Source-hosted films and clips, with provider conditions made explicit.'}]}/>
 </article>
</Shell>
